00:18:58,358 --> 00:19:00,179
[SPEAKER_01]: But there wouldn't be no movement, it has no matter.

222
00:19:01,140 --> 00:19:01,460
[SPEAKER_01]: Just think.

223
00:19:04,952 --> 00:19:18,987
[SPEAKER_01]: So, basically, the planes of movement, the possibility of movement, is already given to you beforehand by that relationship, by that external relationship of matter and consciousness.

224
00:19:20,764 --> 00:19:23,085
[SPEAKER_01]: That's how you disown the movement as well.

225
00:19:23,145 --> 00:19:27,567
[SPEAKER_01]: The most personal of the intentions, choices, intentional intentions.

226
00:19:27,587 --> 00:19:28,188
[SPEAKER_01]: Attention.

