[SPEAKER_00]: Well, yeah, yeah, of course, yeah, yeah, exactly, yeah, yeah.

236
00:20:21,236 --> 00:20:25,218
[SPEAKER_01]: That's why space, although it's not, like, the fundamental, eh...

