00:21:42,747 --> 00:21:42,927
[SPEAKER_01]: No.

248
00:21:42,987 --> 00:21:46,729
[SPEAKER_01]: The notion of space that is present within which this movement is possible.

249
00:21:46,769 --> 00:21:48,009
[SPEAKER_01]: Movement reveals the space.

