00:21:50,130 --> 00:21:51,211
[SPEAKER_01]: Things that move reveal...

251
00:21:51,351 --> 00:21:53,572
[SPEAKER_01]: Things in space move.

252
00:21:57,047 --> 00:22:00,650
[SPEAKER_01]: So, movement in regard to things, basically, it's what the intention is.

253
00:22:00,670 --> 00:22:02,271
[SPEAKER_01]: Hence, things are intentional.

